        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Dooley Group bring to the market this 3 bedroom Detached property within walking distance to the town centre.\n\nLocated in Knockane this 3 bedroom B rated Detached property is in a prime location, within walking distance to the town centre and local schools.\n\nThe property has been vacant for in excess of 2 years so should qualify for the vacant house grant (worth up to 50,000) subject to application, criteria and approval.\n\nThe property has a bright entrance hallway, large Sitting Room with open fire and a large Kitchen/Dining area aswell as W/C on the ground floor with 3 large double bedrooms and main bathroom on the first floor.\n\nThis property must be viewed to be appreciated. Viewings are by appointment only through REA Dooley Group on 069-61888.\n\n\nEntrance Hallway - 8'2 (2.49m) x 16'7 (5.05m)\nLaminate Flooring\n\nSitting Room - 10'8 (3.25m) x 16'2 (4.93m)\nLaminate Flooring, Open Fire\n\nKitchen Dining - 12'10 (3.91m) x 18'11 (5.77m)\nTiled Flooring, Fitted Kitchen\n\nDownstairs W/C - 5'6 (1.68m) x 4'6 (1.37m)\nTiled Floor, W.C, W.H.B.\n\nBedroom 1 - 6'11 (2.11m) x 10'2 (3.1m)\nCarpet Flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 10'2 (3.1m) x 11'10 (3.61m)\nCarpet Flooring, Built in Wardrobe\n\nMaster Bedroom - 11'5 (3.48m) x 15'10 (4.83m)\nCarpet Flooring, Built in Wardrobe\n\nEn Suite\n1.03M x 3.47\nTiled Floor to Ceiling, Shower, W.C, W.H.B.\n\nBathroom - 6'4 (1.93m) x 8'5 (2.57m)\nTiled floor to ceiling, Shower, W.C., W.H.B\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
